      "value": "It is absolutely an OR search.\nAt the time of writing the following works: Search for \"exile urhgan\", it should return two worlds. \"Exile (Halo 4)\", and \"Aht Urhgan Whitegate\".\nSearching for just one of these terms will only return one world.",
