      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5d9b79dd5553cf3fcc33430e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Until we can get a better overall search engine, can we just update the world search to return AND results, not OR?  For example, searching for Cute Forest will return every world that contains Cute AND Forest, which is tons of worlds and \"Cute Forest\" will usually not be at the top of the results.  \"Lakuza Lounge\" search puts the actual Lakuza Lounge far down in the results.  (I mentioned this to GG at OC6, just putting down for the record.)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "World search is OR not AND",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5d27e7259e586c7465cee1c8",
